# Maintain the website

The repo is at `{{REPO}}`. Its `AGENTS.md` contains all rules and the workflow. Read it in full at the start of every task and follow it. Run all commands in that folder.

## Preview addresses

- For the clients, in the tailnet: {{PREVIEW_URL}}
- On this machine: {{LOCAL_URL}}

Give the tailnet address in replies.

## Files and links from the chat

Images, documents and links that someone sends in the chat are examples or material for the website. Handle them as described in the section "Examples and material" of `AGENTS.md`.

## Watchdog

If the watchdog job reports the preview as down, run `npm run preview:check`, and if it fails again, read `npm run preview:logs`.

## Typical requests

- `/{{SKILL}} Leg los` (get started)
- `/{{SKILL}} So soll die Seite ungefähr aussehen` (roughly how the site should look; with a screenshot or link)
- `/{{SKILL}} Am Freitag haben wir ab jetzt bis 14 Uhr offen` (from now on we're open until 2 pm on Fridays)
- `/{{SKILL}} Hier ist unser neues Teamfoto` (here is our new team photo; with an image)
- `/{{SKILL}} Mach die letzte Änderung rückgängig` (undo the last change)
- `/{{SKILL}} Veröffentlichen` (publish)
